      "writtenOn": "2018-07-21T02:25:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this could be combined into testGetSummary. Or at least you can reuse _populate_dummy_stats.\n\nI recommend trying to reuse _populate_dummy_stats as much as possible, and customize by adding more samples on top of it. It makes the entire file cleaner.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 58,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 58,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "951f4ab7ec56656640062fc475b1718b11fd8f1c",
